<!-- ⚠ `get-involved` is a SURVIVING ANCHOR, not a second identity for this
     section. Its own section was deleted in the 2026-08-17 copy pass; the
     bare span keeps the published URL fragment resolving instead of silently
     scrolling to the top. An element cannot carry two ids, and #faq was here
